        515.3219604492188,
        97.6623306274414
      ],
      "text": "detection, irrespective of rifampicin resistance with culture-based phenotypic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        97.97423553466797,
        241.03811645507812,
        112.0622329711914
      ],
      "text": "DST as the reference standard",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        238.88241577148438,
        526.5006713867188,
        249.63742065429688
      ],
      "text": "CI: confidence interval; DIAMA: Diagnostics for Multidrug Resistant Tuberculosis in Africa; DST: drug susceptibility",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        249.68240356445312,
        526.5274047851562,
        260.4374084472656
      ],
      "text": "testing; FIND: Foundation for Innovative New Diagnostics; FN: false negative; FP: false positive; TB: tuberculosis;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.4823913574219,
        210.4021453857422,
        271.2373962402344
      ],
      "text": "TN: true negative; TP: true positive.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        288.24560546875,
        526.6119995117188,
        301.390625
      ],
      "text": "The sensitivity for fluoroquinolone resistance in these three studies ranged from 83% to 100%",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.987493515014648,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.74560546875,
        527.1968383789062,
        316.890625
      ],
      "text": "and the specificity from 84% to 100%.  The pooled sensitivity was 93.1% (95% CI: 88.0–96.1%)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        319.39959716796875,
        381.6600341796875,
        332.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "and the pooled specificity was 98.3% (95% CI: 94.5–99.5%).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        344.1972351074219,
        508.9716491699219,
        358.28521728515625
      ],
      "text": "PICO 3: Should low complexity automated NAATs be used on culture isolates",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38580322265625,
        358.5971374511719,
        497.7517395019531,
        372.68511962890625
      ],
      "text": "in people with signs and symptoms of pulmonary TB, and detected",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38580322265625,
        372.99713134765625,
        512.8045654296875,
        387.0851135253906
      ],
      "text": "resistance to rifampicin, for detection of resistance to ethionamide, as",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.38580322265625,
        387.397216796875,
        458.22564697265625,
        401.66522216796875
      ],
      "text": "compared with genotypic sequencing of the   promoter? inhA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        412.1881103515625,
        526.9039916992188,
        425.3331298828125
      ],
      "text": "One multinational study with 434 participants provided data for evaluating resistance to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        427.6881103515625,
        526.9863891601562,
        440.8331298828125
      ],
      "text": "ethionamide. The reference standard for this study was DNA sequencing of the   promoter.  inhA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.973418235778809,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        443.1881103515625,
        517.4371948242188,
        456.3331298828125
      ],
      "text": "Each study centre in the multinational study was analysed as a separate study ( ). Fig. 2.4.1.3",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.1920166015625,
        527.2616577148438,
        480.3370361328125
      ],
      "text": "The study was judged to be at very serious risk of bias in the reference standard domain because",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.95003604888916,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.6920166015625,
        527.1014404296875,
        495.8370361328125
      ],
      "text": "it did not include all loci (i.e.  ,   and   promoter) required for the reference standard  ethA ethR inhA",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.973969459533691,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        498.1920166015625,
        526.9657592773438,
        511.3370361328125
      ],
      "text": "to classify the target condition correctly. Against a reference standard of phenotypic DST, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        513.6920166015625,
        526.772216796875,
        526.8370361328125
      ],
      "text": "pooled sensitivity was considerably lower, at 51.7% (95% CI: 33.1–69.8%). Consequently,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        529.1920166015625,
        527.2999877929688,
        542.3370361328125
      ],
      "text": "certainty of evidence was downgraded two levels for risk of bias for both sensitivity and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        544.6920166015625,
        526.9645385742188,
        557.8370361328125
      ],
      "text": "specificity. In addition, the 95% CIs were wide for both sensitivity and specificity, which could",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        560.1920166015625,
        526.6724853515625,
        573.3370361328125
      ],
      "text": "lead to different decisions, depending on which confidence limits are assumed. Consequently,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.99484920501709,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        575.6920166015625,
        526.9666748046875,
        588.8370361328125
      ],
      "text": "the certainty of the evidence was downgraded one level for imprecision for both sensitivity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.1920166015625,
        526.9603881835938,
        604.3370361328125
      ],
      "text": "and specificity; the quality (certainty) of evidence was rated very low for both sensitivity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        606.6920166015625,
        142.93801879882812,
        619.8370361328125
      ],
      "text": "and specificity.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        634.4782104492188,
        523.5900268554688,
        648.5662231445312
      ],
      "text": "Fig. 2.4.1.3 Forest plot of included studies for ethionamide resistance detection",
